Well, Fredi (nee Fred until that polymorph trap) finally ascended in
PC version 3.10j. A barbarian. My first win. Yay! 
Useful tips:

A blessed unicorn horn is great!
I don't know how I would've made it through hell without Grey Dragon SM
My weapon was blessed +2 rustproof excalibur. You could do better.
I had about 5 or 6 wishes in the course of the game. They were:
	excalibur
	blessed +3 grey dragon scale mail
	blessed +3 speed boots
	blessed +3 levitation boots
	blessed ring of teleport control
I was able to teleport (within level) with the Amulet - I thought you
couldn't, but maybe that's just between-level teleporting.
